  "_doc": [
    "Kanto trade evolutions made in-game (FireRedHD slice a5.3; installed by b2tools/patches/kanto_trade_evos.py).",
    "Same mechanism as the Hoenn trade_evos patch (see data/trade_evos.json and notes there), re-targeted at the Kanto",
    "build. Black 2's evolution table a/0/1/9 fixes which species have a trade method, so 'evolutions' must cover exactly",
    "that set (the patch asserts traders == keys(evolutions)); the Gen 1 Kanto/Sevii traders (Kadabra, Machoke, Graveler,",
    "Haunter, Poliwhirl, Slowpoke, Onix, Scyther, Seadra) sit alongside the later-gen traders Black 2 already knows.",
    "keep_trade_methods: true keeps Black 2's own link-trade entries too, so a real link trade still evolves them.",
    "shop is intentionally ABSENT: the shop-append (trade_evos step 3) needs Kanto marts (the `shops` content phase).",
    "kanto_trade_evos installs the evolution + Bag-use data now and defers selling the evolution items to Phase 2/3."
